    "chunk_text": "\ufffda gemde se Godes mon symle georne, swa his gewuna w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6r dyde; eallum monnum & toendebyrdnesse his gesih\u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6m monnum anum hit cy\u00fean & secgan wolde, \u00fea \u00f0e hine Is nu gena sum ald bro\u00f0or lifiende usses mynstres, se me s\u00e6gde, cw\u00e6\u00f0 se \u00fee \u00f0as booc wrat, \u00fe\u00e6t & \u00fea gen to\u00e6tecte \u00fe\u00e6t hit w\u00e6re wintres tiid; & se winter w\u00e6re grim & cald & fyrstig & mid Cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se halga wer s\u00e6te in \u00feynnum hr\u00e6gle, & betweoh \u00fea his geseagone fore micelnisse He \u00fees Godes wer monig ger \u00e6rest in Scottum allum \u00fe\u00e6m Godes word bodode & l\u00e6rde. \u00d0a ne meahte he ea\u00f0elice \u00fea unstillnesse onfallendra mengu aberan, \u00fea forlet he eal \u00fea \u00f0ing, \u00fee \u00dea he \u00fe\u00e6t h\u00e6fde mynsterlice & \u00feeawlice geseted, \u00fea wilnade he hine seolfne from eallum Forlet \u00fea \u00f0a scire \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres Fullane his bre\u00f0er & tw\u00e6m m\u00e6ssepreostum Gobbona & Dicula; H\u00e6fde eac o\u00f0erne bro\u00f0or, se w\u00e6s haten Ultanus, se of d\u00e6ghwamlicre gecostnisse \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres & he eall ger mid him in micelre forh\u00e6fdnesse & gebedum & on hongewinnum lifde. \u00c6fter \u00feissum he geseah \u00fea m\u00e6g\u00f0e mid h\u00e6\u00f0enra hergungum gedrefde, ond he foreseah Godes Ond he \u00fe\u00e6r from Hlo\u00f0wi\u00e6 Froncna cyninge & Erconwalde his aldormen arwyr\u00f0lice onfongen \ufffd",
